{"step_index":213,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:24:11Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-21T15:54:11+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-21T15:54:11+05:30\nShowing lines 1-60 of 243\n1: # 🌿 NexusMobility — Smart City Carpooling & Eco-Logistics Platform\n2: \n3: [![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-emerald.svg)](LICENSE)\n4: [![Standard: C++20](https://img.shields.io/badge/C%2B%2B-20%2F17-blue.svg)](https://isocpp.org/)\n5: [![UI: Modern Eco-Tech](https://img.shields.io/badge/UI-Eco--Tech%20Light-059669.svg)](#design-system--visual-aesthetic)\n6: [![Status: Production Ready](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Audited%20%26%20Hardened-green.svg)](#code-audit--stability-guarantees)\n7: \n8: **NexusMobility** is a modern, enterprise-ready smart urban transit and eco-carpooling platform engineered for smart city administrators, commuter networks, and fleet operators. It combines an ultra-clean, high-contrast eco-tech user interface with a robust, thread-safe C++ backend engine for real-time pathfinding, capacity scheduling, and carbon-reduction analytics.\n9: \n10: > [!NOTE]\n11: > **Zero CS / Academic Jargon Policy:** The entire user interface and documentation are framed strictly in terms of transit operations, passenger workflows, and sustainability metrics. Underlying computational techniques (Dijkstra shortest path, circular ring buffers, FIFO queues, LIFO rollback stacks) operate invisibly under the hood.\n12: \n13: ---\n14: \n15: ## 📑 Table of Contents\n16: - [🌟 Key Platform Capabilities](#-key-platform-capabilities)\n17: - [🎨 Design System & Visual Aesthetic](#-design-system--visual-aesthetic)\n18: - [🏛️ Tabbed Page Architecture](#️-tabbed-page-architecture)\n19: - [⚙️ Technical Architecture](#️-technical-architecture)\n20: - [🚀 Quick Start & Operation Guide](#-quick-start--operation-guide)\n21:   - [Option A: Standalone Front-End (Instant Run)](#option-a-standalone-front-end-instant-run)\n22:   - [Option B: Full-Stack with C++ REST API Server](#option-b-full-stack-with-c-rest-api-server)\n23: - [🔌 C++ REST API Reference](#-c-rest-api-reference)\n24: - [🛡️ Code Audit & Stability Guarantees](#️-code-audit--stability-guarantees)\n25: - [📂 Repository File Tree](#-repository-file-tree)\n26: \n27: ---\n28: \n29: ## 🌟 Key Platform Capabilities\n30: \n31: 1. **3D Spatial Metropolitan Route Corridor Canvas**:\n32:    - Interactive 3D vector map of metropolitan transit hubs and connecting corridors.\n33:    - Real-time route calculation with dynamic directional chevrons and animated electric transit vehicles driving along active transit paths.\n34:    - Mouse-driven 3D orbit and zoom controls with elevation stems and floor shadows.\n35: \n36: 2. **Dynamic Pooled Fare & CO₂ Offset Calculator**:\n37:    - Commuter density slider (1 to 4 passengers) showing real-time fare splitting and carbon reduction compared to single-occupancy vehicles.\n38: \n39: 3. **Live Commuter Dispatch Conveyor**:\n40:    - Smooth, priority-ordered passenger conveyor pipeline with real-time status tracking.\n41: \n42: 4. **Circular Priority Standby Lounge (5 Slots)**:\n43:    - Modulo-based fixed 5-slot standby lounge with visual circular ring layout, active pointer markers, and capacity overflow alerts.\n44: \n45: 5. **Driver Fleet Management & Interactive Vehicle Blueprint**:\n46:    - Top-down 4-seat vehicle blueprint with interactive seat toggling (Driver + 3 Passenger seats).\n47:    - Dynamic fleet partner capacity badges and fleet directory stream.\n48: \n49: 6. **Instant Identity Verification & Search**:\n50:    - Fast $O(1)$ search bar supporting Driver Partner IDs (e.g., `#101`) and Booking References (e.g., `NX-501`).\n51: \n52: 7. **Reversible Dispatch Audit Log (Rollback Stack)**:\n53:    - Enterprise-grade undo mechanism (`Revert Last Confirmation`) allowing dispatchers to instantly cancel erroneous confirmations, restore driver seats, and return passengers to the front of the queue without priority penalty.\n54: \n55: 8. **Enterprise Journey Modals & Printable Eco-Receipts**:\n56:    - Modal confirmation dialogs with alignment percentages, ETA, fare split, and printable physical receipts with `@media print` stylesheets.\n57: \n58: 9. **EcoSprout Mascot & Ambient Visuals**:\n59:    - Friendly vector eco-mascot (**EcoSprout**) with aviator goggles providing context-aware guidance during empty states.\n60:    - Ambient background canvas rendering gentle floating leaves and subtle electric energy nodes."}
{"step_index":214,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:24:11Z","input_tokens":3435,"cache_read_tokens":130642,"output_tokens":7825,"tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Updated index.html to fix congested layout: streamlined tab nav to flex-row wrap with badges, split Tab 1 into a spacious side-by-side workspace (controls panel on left, 3D spatial map canvas & metrics on right), and structured form groups cleanly with proper spacing.","UserFacing":true},"Content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>NexusMobility — Smart City Eco-Logistics & Carpooling Platform</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/js/all.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-eco-light text-slate-800\">\n  <!-- Ambient Eco Particle Canvas Layer (Leaves & Energy Nodes) -->\n  <canvas id=\"ambient-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\"></canvas>\n\n  <div class=\"app-layout relative z-10\">\n    <!-- Top Header Navigation -->\n    <header class=\"app-header white-card\">\n      <div class=\"brand-section\">\n        <div class=\"brand-icon\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-leaf text-emerald\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"brand-title-wrap\">\n          <div class=\"brand-title\">\n            <span>Nexus<span class=\"text-emerald\">Mobility</span></span>\n            <span class=\"brand-badge\">Enterprise Eco-Tech</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"brand-tagline\">SMART TRANSIT & URBAN ECO-LOGISTICS SUITE</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Essential Primary Action Controls -->\n      <div class=\"nav-actions\">\n        <button id=\"btn-demo-rushhour\" class=\"btn btn-emerald-outline\" title=\"Simulate realistic metropolitan rush hour traffic\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-bolt-lightning text-emerald\"></i> Rush-Hour Simulation\n        </button>\n        <button id=\"btn-quick-book\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-calendar-check\"></i> Book Eco-Ride\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Global Executive KPI Ribbon -->\n    <section class=\"kpi-banner\">\n      <div class=\"kpi-card eco-card-hover\">\n        <div class=\"kpi-icon-wrap bg-emerald-light\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-down text-emerald\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"kpi-content\">\n          <div class=\"kpi-label\">CO₂ EMISSIONS SAVED</div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-value text-emerald\" id=\"kpi-co2\">148.5 <span class=\"kpi-unit\">kg</span></div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-subtext\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up text-emerald\"></i> +18.4% this week</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"kpi-card eco-card-hover\">\n        <div class=\"kpi-icon-wrap bg-blue-light\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-car-side text-electric\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"kpi-content\">\n          <div class=\"kpi-label\">SOLO TRIPS DIVERTED</div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-value text-electric\" id=\"kpi-vehicles-diverted\">412 <span class=\"kpi-unit\">cars</span></div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-subtext\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-road text-electric\"></i> Congestion reduction</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"kpi-card eco-card-hover\">\n        <div class=\"kpi-icon-wrap bg-amber-light\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-users-viewfinder text-amber\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"kpi-content\">\n          <div class=\"kpi-label\">DISPATCH DEMAND</div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-value text-amber\" id=\"kpi-commuters\">0 <span class=\"kpi-unit\">commuters</span></div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-subtext\">Real-time demand stream</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"kpi-card eco-card-hover\">\n        <div class=\"kpi-icon-wrap bg-purple-light\">\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-purple\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"kpi-content\">\n          <div class=\"kpi-label\">ACTIVE SHARED TRIPS</div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-value text-purple\" id=\"kpi-active-trips\">0 <span class=\"kpi-unit\">trips</span></div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-subtext\">In-transit fleet capacity</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 4 Primary Navigation Tabs -->\n    <nav class=\"tab-navbar white-card\">\n      <button class=\"tab-trigger active\" data-tab=\"tab-route-finder\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-map-location-dot\"></i>\n        <span>1. Eco-Route Finder & Map</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"tab-trigger\" data-tab=\"tab-passenger-hub\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-users\"></i>\n        <span>2. Commuter Passenger Hub</span>\n        <span class=\"tab-badge\" id=\"tab-passengers-badge\">0</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"tab-trigger\" data-tab=\"tab-fleet-dispatch\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-car-side\"></i>\n        <span>3. Driver Fleet & Dispatch Console</span>\n        <span class=\"tab-badge\" id=\"tab-fleet-badge\">0</span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"tab-trigger\" data-tab=\"tab-sustainability\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chart-line\"></i>\n        <span>4. City Sustainability Analytics</span>\n      </button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Tabbed Content Area -->\n    <main class=\"tab-content-container\">\n\n      <!-- ==========================================\n           TAB 1: ECO-ROUTE FINDER & MAP (SPACIOUS 2-COL WORKSPACE)\n           ========================================== -->\n      <section id=\"tab-route-finder\" class=\"tab-view active\">\n        <div class=\"view-grid-map\">\n\n          <!-- Left Column: Interactive Trip Configuration Panel -->\n          <div class=\"route-selector-panel white-card eco-card-hover\">\n            <div class=\"card-header-clean\">\n              <div>\n                <h3 class=\"card-title\">\n                  <i class=\"fa-solid fa-route text-emerald\"></i>\n                  <span>Plan Eco-Corridor Transit</span>\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"card-subtitle\">Configure origin, destination, and passenger ride-sharing parameters</p>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"brand-badge\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-bolt text-emerald\"></i> Live Grid</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Route Origin & Destination Fields -->\n            <div class=\"route-form-fields\">\n              <div class=\"field-group\">\n                <label class=\"field-label\" for=\"route-origin\">\n                  <i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-dot text-emerald\"></i> Origin Station\n                </label>\n                <select id=\"route-origin\" class=\"select-field\"></select>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"route-interchange-row\">\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon-circle\" id=\"btn-swap-route\" title=\"Swap Origin and Destination\">\n                  <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-down-up-across-line\"></i>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"field-group\">\n                <label class=\"field-label\" for=\"route-destination\">\n                  <i class=\"fa-solid fa-location-dot text-rose\"></i> Destination Station\n                </label>\n                <select id=\"route-destination\" class=\"select-field\"></select>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Commuter Density & Fare Splitting Slider -->\n            <div class=\"commuter-slider-box\">\n              <div class=\"slider-header\">\n                <div>\n                  <div class=\"field-label\">\n                    <i class=\"fa-solid fa-user-group text-emerald\"></i> Pooled Commuter Density\n                  </div>\n                  <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Live fare splitting & emissions offset</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"fare-pill\">\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono\">SEAT FARE:</span>\n                  <span class=\"font-bold text-emerald text-sm\" id=\"slider-fare-display\">$7.45</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <input type=\"range\" id=\"commuter-range-slider\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" value=\"2\" class=\"slider-range-input\" />\n              <div class=\"slider-ticks\">\n                <span class=\"tick\">1 Solo</span>\n                <span class=\"tick active-tick\" id=\"tick-2\">2 Pooled</span>\n                <span class=\"tick\" id=\"tick-3\">3 Pooled</span>\n                <span class=\"tick\" id=\"tick-4\">4 Max</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Action Buttons Row -->\n            <div class=\"route-actions-row\">\n              <button id=\"btn-calc-route\" class=\"btn btn-primary flex-1\">\n                <i class=\"fa-solid fa-calculator\"></i> Calculate Route\n              </button>\n              <button id=\"btn-simulate-drive\" class=\"btn btn-emerald-outline\" title=\"Simulate vehicle traversing the route\">\n                <i class=\"fa-solid fa-play\"></i> Drive\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Right Column: 3D Spatial Metropolitan Canvas & Telemetry -->\n          <div class=\"map-card-wrapper white-card eco-card-hover\">\n            <div class=\"card-header-clean\">\n              <div>\n                <h3 class=\"card-