st-container\" class=\"toast-container\"></div>\n\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:/Users/Kartik Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html"}}]}
